Package: crimeTrajec
Type: Package
Title: Group-Based Trajectory Modeling for Longitudinal Criminology Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Author", "Name", email = "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Contributor", "Name", email = "contributor@example.com", role = "ctb"))
Description: Implements group-based trajectory modeling for longitudinal criminology
    data using finite mixture models. The package provides tools for fitting trajectory
    models with various distributions (Poisson, zero-inflated Poisson, Gaussian),
    selecting the optimal number of trajectory groups using information criteria and
    cross-validation, and visualizing results. Methods are based on Nagin (2005)
    <doi:10.4159/9780674041318> and Jones et al. (2001) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-9531.2001.tb00003.x>.
